  "title": "French Dip Sandwiches",
  "description": "This sandwich is enjoying a renaissance, in slow-cooked versions. Here, soy sauce, rosemary, and thyme add depth of flavor to the broth that develops over 10 to 12 hours of cooking.",
  "authors": [
    "Giselle"
  ],
